[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667673445","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103016#issuecomment-2667673445","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103016","id":2667673445,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fAXdl","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T07:00:39Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T07:00:39Z","body":"Because this PR makes the control so much wider (regardless of whether you choose to use icons or not), perhaps this is a good time to reconsider whether this setting should even be in the main window taking up all that space at all. In my main project I have literally never touched it, and I suspect that most professional game devs working in one project for a longer amount of time make an educated decision about this in their project exactly once before never touching it again. \r\n\r\nThis is a project setting, which belongs in the project settings. There, this field can be as long and informative as is necessary.\r\n\r\nI understand this is part proposal, but it is also very related to this PR, so I wanted to mention this here before we annoy more pro game devs like me with wasted screen real estate.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667673445/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667735648","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103016#issuecomment-2667735648","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103016","id":2667735648,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fAmpg","user":{"login":"tetrapod00","id":145553014,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKz2dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145553014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00","html_url":"https://github.com/tetrapod00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T07:29:41Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T07:31:51Z","body":"As I understand it, including the rendering method in the editor so prominently is mainly to make troubleshooting easier for engine developers (and incidentally, helpers in community channels like the forums or Discord). Including the renderer in screenshots saves one step in the troubleshooting process. See the original context in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/70500 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5979.\r\n\r\nI think a separate proposal to add a project/editor setting to hide it would be good. It's been brought up before, but not discussed extensively: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/70500#issuecomment-1374281891. If the default remains the renderer being visible in the editor, most screenshots will still include the information. And advanced users can hide it if they know what they are doing. In any case, IMO a full proposal is the proper place to discuss it, not the comments of PRs.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667735648/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667897122","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103016#issuecomment-2667897122","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103016","id":2667897122,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fBOEi","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T08:28:39Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T08:28:39Z","body":"Exactly, the entire point of this is to BE prominent.\r\n\r\nI love the proposal, I wouldn't move to icons as they're less clear (And potentially a problem for VI devs, there was a recent Reddit post by one so it's not a hypothetical dev)\r\n\r\nThe only thing I'd change would be to use a shorthand or a synonym for overridden as the word does get quite long. \"Ov.\"? \"Forced\"?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667897122/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667989297","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103016#issuecomment-2667989297","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103016","id":2667989297,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fBkkx","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T09:07:29Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T09:07:29Z","body":"I think we need to be very careful merging user-hostile changes to make things marginally more convenient for engine developers. \r\n\r\nWe have received a lot of feedback from users that the size and prominence of the current button is annoying and many have even suggested removing the button. Adriaan is not alone in feeling this way.\r\n\r\nPersonally, as an engine developer, I don't even see the value in having this information displayed so prominently. Users don't typically share full screen screenshots, so I rarely see the existing button. \r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667989297/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2668072306","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103016#issuecomment-2668072306","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103016","id":2668072306,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fB41y","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T09:40:58Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T09:40:58Z","body":"The rest of the discussion about whether to keep the rendering method there or not can move to the proposal I just made for this! https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11806","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2668072306/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2668093687","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103016#issuecomment-2668093687","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103016","id":2668093687,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fB-D3","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T09:49:33Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T09:49:41Z","body":"> As I understand it, including the rendering method in the editor so prominently is mainly to make troubleshooting easier for engine developers (and incidentally, helpers in community channels like the forums or Discord). Including the renderer in screenshots saves one step in the troubleshooting process.\r\n\r\nIf it's only for analyzing screenshots, it can be added in a more discreet way, like a tiny color coded dot near the engine version or something similar (with a tooltip showing full info).\r\n\r\n<img width=\"354\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-19 at 11 44 56\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca96db97-57d1-4f8e-bd4d-dc931c202823\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2668093687/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4198780680","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103016#issuecomment-4198780680","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103016","id":4198780680,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76RE8I","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.git